    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-41a4a46c-c3b2-4da8-9054-41e4d730b4c8" n="0116" facs="#m-73d8b27d-ef80-4759-9250-4e5e12f220c0" /><div xml:id="m-b4a38caa-8455-4696-9a1d-793743d43adc">
            <lg xml:id="m-ed1e1e73-3d0e-4788-8e70-9e709c3a1dd0">
              <l xml:id="m-65c676ba-211e-4a51-b541-975dc8814e2c" facs="#m-4332ad40-148a-45a3-a759-cc84034caa0d" label="text-like">The Ordinary of the Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-32cb09c6-56c6-489d-9506-98db6318c2c4" facs="#m-e0ac7207-645e-42f0-8c60-24980439062b" label="lyrics-like">Nobis quoque peccatóribus fámu-(Christum Filium tuum. Qui tecum</l><l xml:id="m-fa87789a-d27f-466a-90c4-70660d6f97dd" facs="#m-b0891045-425f-44e8-9577-84ecbd6de590" label="lyrics-like">lis tuis, de multitúdine miseratió¬</l><l xml:id="m-ef9b4054-013a-4888-a094-92dd7e5c71cf" facs="#m-4026ab7d-5535-4682-8095-aeb468185d87" label="lyrics-like">vivit et regnat in unitá̂te Spfritus</l><l xml:id="m-01a1e189-ef01-44a5-8116-b61a828f0635" facs="#m-85d95ca3-d956-4a6a-b2d1-cd049b611cff" label="ambiguous">Sanctis Deus.</l><l xml:id="m-4651301c-df00-49fd-8c4a-86d4d071c90b" facs="#m-b2c06589-558f-4502-bea5-6d6bef2dff68" label="lyrics-like">num tuárum sperántibus, partem</l><l xml:id="m-b10c0351-d576-47d3-9e95-ad64ef409e7f" facs="#m-fca5f3ac-9de4-4ebd-8987-49b59050d104" label="lyrics-like">áliquam, et societátem donâre di¬</l><l xml:id="m-4a9da6a8-710f-45a9-ad35-cd58548d8c76" facs="#m-ce9cf3b4-7273-4541-924a-15247a3bb71a" label="lyrics-like">Per ómnia saécula saeculórum.</l><l xml:id="m-9b66b880-33a4-4ca0-8739-c9f02f9b3fda" facs="#m-1d34e55c-acf9-4307-8dba-12156b8f796f" label="lyrics-like">gnéris, cum tuis sanctis Apóstolis</l><l xml:id="m-0783c806-ea51-442c-83ff-85da6ebe34a4" facs="#m-65669274-698d-485f-a807-3480c85ab9d9" label="ambiguous">R. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-5b07774f-b2f4-4d99-81d6-7f3ca11f5b7e" facs="#m-44e3916c-b667-4a53-852c-27227d9ab5e4" label="lyrics-like">ẽt Martyribus : cum Joânne, Sté¬</l><l xml:id="m-7722e2b4-5f1f-477b-ac61-f093ba9b305b" facs="#m-a9247d59-583d-48cb-80fe-c347123fd51b" label="lyrics-like">Pax Dómini sit semper vobíscum.</l><l xml:id="m-e04e66e2-e491-46e7-85c6-651b26bd0e77" facs="#m-18bb1bb8-8a55-4873-986c-d6e501f1150d" label="lyrics-like">phano, Matthía, Bárnaba. Ignátio</l><l xml:id="m-43f59a3c-fc06-4985-b133-47bbf2eda1d0" facs="#m-6c2a4581-6d30-423a-b0f3-39c69bae2aed" label="lyrics-like">R. Et cum spiritu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-e96ee2c3-8471-4769-aa93-62464f2dc6a3" facs="#m-25375972-fe5c-4d49-8d9a-e445dd51ef5e" label="lyrics-like">Alexándro, Marcellino, Petro, Fe¬</l><l xml:id="m-823b8566-03a7-4aed-a591-e211490b5bfc" facs="#m-562db9fd-1703-4b5e-8a34-d02903739684" label="lyrics-like">Haec commixtio et consecrátio</l><l xml:id="m-f5b15978-f2ba-46fc-950d-21e6687269b1" facs="#m-f4a1d03a-309d-48ba-89e0-614fa2303baa" label="lyrics-like">licitáte, Perpétua, Agatha, Lúcia.</l><l xml:id="m-0f969bc4-8364-43d4-a321-aa1e6f7b5902" facs="#m-7f86657f-ec41-476b-a042-ae84c45331c9" label="lyrics-like">Córporis et Sánguinis Dómini nostri</l><l xml:id="m-98a75f7f-d373-4f9e-a0f3-309438b743da" facs="#m-bd7b6e31-71ff-461a-b4e2-e92c1767ade2" label="lyrics-like">Agnéte, Caecilia, Anastásia, et</l><l xml:id="m-2d55eb5a-1500-42ce-8151-4a8812a97de5" facs="#m-f5ccd99b-79c2-4a81-8e27-b4355511c34a" label="lyrics-like">lesú Christi fiat accipiéntibus nobis</l><l xml:id="m-2bef9efc-decf-4d23-8e52-82fd9a56eb03" facs="#m-2bc7f692-a62a-451c-bbb0-d07392796ee6" label="lyrics-like">ómnibus Sanctis tuis: intra quorum</l><l xml:id="m-4246d23c-f5b6-4b59-ad73-6942ae44772d" facs="#m-428132c1-71e8-42d7-a610-218f91b53746" label="lyrics-like">in vitam aetérnam. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-450b61c6-767c-42a5-8de2-ebd9f951c8a7" facs="#m-d3b38dce-dd53-4be7-a64e-46fbe1eab49d" label="lyrics-like">nos consórtium, non aestimátor</l><l xml:id="m-9e1b791f-5755-43a4-9050-ec974c4d4b9b" facs="#m-c1dbb89f-3820-4da9-8de3-dda5287e77fb" label="lyrics-like">Agnus Déi, qui tóllis peccáta</l><l xml:id="m-e26baff0-f228-4ce1-9b7f-14435946e6c7" facs="#m-0d7fe561-45d7-4275-ade8-c67b3babd129" label="lyrics-like">mériti, sed véniae, quaésumus, lar¬</l><l xml:id="m-0dc23555-d932-4602-84ff-5745bc122893" facs="#m-fe1320d2-2ed0-41e6-a25e-06ccb6dc5dc2" label="lyrics-like">múndi : miserére nóbis</l><l xml:id="m-7dad0ea1-16d2-4617-81a9-d0a492fb97ad" facs="#m-450e50a4-29e3-4aaf-80f9-7f2e623f4165" label="lyrics-like">gitor admitte. Per Christum Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-facc64bf-d916-4fdb-bed6-e1e553a5ad5c" facs="#m-4886e761-095a-4182-a1f2-dccc9d7a2377" label="lyrics-like">Agnus Déi, qui tóllis peccáta</l><l xml:id="m-b857dcda-7799-4ee8-a809-56852b1a6f93" facs="#m-69daf0af-dbc6-4499-b532-8d33a46bfbeb" label="lyrics-like">num nostrum. Perquem haec ómnia,</l><l xml:id="m-44adc8cf-6f79-4508-a235-d1015586f321" facs="#m-916573ba-6006-443a-ae20-8bf84f3b7e15" label="lyrics-like">múndi: miserére nóbis.</l><l xml:id="m-98eb334a-0eb4-4220-92f9-0df4a2224063" facs="#m-865d48d1-b161-4740-b42b-929949624dbe" label="lyrics-like">Dómine, semper bona creas, sanctí¬</l><l xml:id="m-bb28498e-b230-4e3f-8cb5-94b94c0b63d6" facs="#m-bd841450-4f51-48a3-8579-303ebec5b496" label="lyrics-like">Agnus Déi, qui tóllis peccáta</l><l xml:id="m-a8bcd4a8-e206-40a2-9e33-0b1d245d524c" facs="#m-b6284fdd-bcf4-4dfc-8526-86619b584192" label="lyrics-like">ficas, vivíficas, benedícis, et prae¬</l><l xml:id="m-1224fba9-54a7-4947-9fe2-28e4064c2597" facs="#m-51e28157-7f8d-4b90-a1a4-e6b4bb3803ba" label="lyrics-like">múndi : dóna nóbis pacem.</l><l xml:id="m-ab4f6348-f66d-42d8-9e92-e37c6f35ab1b" facs="#m-0ba65c07-19cc-47c3-b1ba-93453ab4e57b" label="ambiguous">stas nobis. Per ipsum, et cum ipso,</l><l xml:id="m-d85ed081-1bee-4b8e-91de-5b262f1f7cf2" facs="#m-25fd06e5-baaa-4ba6-987b-3c6e788f1d20" label="ambiguous">et in ipso, est tibi Deo Patri omni¬</l><l xml:id="m-6eaa15ba-38e4-4b91-b948-f15c16ab8f52" facs="#m-e95659af-ad69-4ffe-b70a-0e67f07223de" label="text-like">In Masses for the Dead, the woras</l><l xml:id="m-3d9a989a-2bdc-41aa-a11c-43a25adad8a2" facs="#m-01b9f92c-0648-4b6e-ad2a-407bd523233a" label="lyrics-like">poténti, in unitáte Spiritus Sancti</l><l xml:id="m-fb06be06-7e2c-43cd-9b23-ae5f51bfb747" facs="#m-d881522d-c12c-4497-8387-754ef30a2173" label="lyrics-like">miserére nóbis, are reptaced by dóna</l><l xml:id="m-45ce850e-d0fd-4604-82b3-975a9ac11cef" facs="#m-142ce6ae-0438-4d4c-a478-afe312664100" label="lyrics-like">omnis honor et glória.</l><l xml:id="m-69f87d05-0826-4b0e-b97b-8deac581b072" facs="#m-0e2cc987-92a8-46fc-89c7-464c6ccd1f22" label="lyrics-like">éis réquiem, and the wora sempitér¬</l><l xml:id="m-894de0be-3940-44c2-a327-11fa878357d5" facs="#m-5274f77d-2ce2-4a93-b3e4-d796330675dd" label="lyrics-like">Per ómnia saécula saeculórum.</l><l xml:id="m-91bfcc46-e8c6-4352-82dd-ee3bdbbc9391" facs="#m-1e54f05a-f436-42a7-b1a1-04861e9053d5" label="text-like">nam is added the thira time; atso,</l><l xml:id="m-08d70afe-1b15-411e-8e45-019c64ff11b3" facs="#m-6d9f88a9-7e17-4a6a-8635-bf574019ef0d" label="ambiguous">W. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-980a278d-2d69-4662-8db5-b0d0599ee6ca" facs="#m-681d5594-fd5b-442b-99e1-ad9877f44aab" label="text-like">the first of the fottowing Prayers is</l><l xml:id="m-5c73f978-5a3e-45d1-bdcc-dc88bed231d9" facs="#m-62bef115-421f-401f-83a9-c7b78bca7b0b" label="ambiguous">omitted.</l><l xml:id="m-9ba2eabd-fff0-43f1-95fb-90c5bf79625a" facs="#m-9f01a64e-9b22-42ed-9b08-810bdbdc4347" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-1231eb6e-1585-4336-84e2-c590e4238dd7" facs="#m-f2e5d387-8a5e-4560-985d-510f4d5f6a10" label="ambiguous">LOmine Jesu Christe, qui dixisti</l><l xml:id="m-5b114b60-a4fd-4951-92c0-e9894a66b3fd" facs="#m-a4136f13-6dd1-4508-aee5-81e9972fa12e" label="lyrics-like">Praecéptis salutáribus móniti, et</l><l xml:id="m-fe69cb35-255f-48c9-85c9-867f56221f9f" facs="#m-cb77b5df-912c-43e8-8b24-711db8952a78" label="lyrics-like">U Apóstolis tuis : Pacem relinquo</l><l xml:id="m-ce302804-eafe-45b6-90cc-2d819754815d" facs="#m-9c02d733-c136-4c84-91cf-ee682cb4923c" label="lyrics-like">divina institutióne formáti, audé¬</l><l xml:id="m-2e372f53-077c-440c-8507-cbafb9abd5e0" facs="#m-e924d5e8-818f-4393-9c01-b8ebe8d2b5ca" label="ambiguous">vobis, pacem meam do vobis: ne</l><l xml:id="m-864af3b3-20eb-47e6-8749-e20aee2be572" facs="#m-91fdea5e-0b98-4ae8-ab79-63879eb95f79" label="ambiguous">mus dicere:</l><l xml:id="m-3eeed7d4-0d85-4b9d-ae8a-594f15a24a49" facs="#m-69194fef-344c-4ab1-98e2-776c4804a7de" label="lyrics-like">respicias peccáta mea, sed fidem</l><l xml:id="m-a8912726-e19e-4065-a0ce-f9ab647f76c4" facs="#m-9804e838-8fe0-4c43-9412-945eee3f45a5" label="lyrics-like">DAter nóster, qui es in caélis</l><l xml:id="m-239c9093-a4fa-4539-9f15-7a5e26af8b8d" facs="#m-5e65a165-e054-4394-8a99-bfab63f9ea0c" label="lyrics-like">Ecclésiae tuae: eámque secúndum</l><l xml:id="m-dd9c72f7-1718-459d-be95-6554c22f4909" facs="#m-df85ab48-340f-42c4-b050-635cbe215154" label="lyrics-like">Sanctificétur nómen túum : Ad¬</l><l xml:id="m-0a2dbf5a-e0c3-4082-8c45-cc3ab90d1dea" facs="#m-4a885fea-3fcc-48ba-b0e3-f55c0f5944d0" label="lyrics-like">voluntátem tuam pacificâre et coa¬</l><l xml:id="m-7c17998e-0ea7-4146-8356-8489fc4606d8" facs="#m-b1992f3c-e362-4f93-9f56-f28fe9993faf" label="lyrics-like">dunáre dignéris : qui vivis et regnas</l><l xml:id="m-b3549ad0-0234-44df-8977-1c2ea1957215" facs="#m-33fe4052-4c94-4bb7-840d-1a43dafb19c6" label="lyrics-like">véniat régnum túum : Fiat volún¬</l><l xml:id="m-593a373d-15d2-4b09-971f-1aabbad765a2" facs="#m-afd29ae3-99b1-4f36-85f8-680c6e01969f" label="lyrics-like">Deus per ómnia saécula sacculó¬</l><l xml:id="m-57f30c7e-fc91-45b5-afd9-359531aae815" facs="#m-70915747-a5f2-475a-9f02-69232197426b" label="lyrics-like">tas túa, sicut in caélo, et in térra¬</l><l xml:id="m-dd2d5da3-3afa-43d1-aed3-c4375e4445ef" facs="#m-ebfeca20-b255-4cb9-b533-9af3c7589f8a" label="lyrics-like">Pánem nóstrum quotidiánum da</l><l xml:id="m-d1d65716-5d0e-4bde-8593-80575be8ea56" facs="#m-b0abda86-6e10-407b-98a8-2ebb88e9d409" label="ambiguous">rum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-b782395c-22a8-4b75-82b2-1ca17ee05b15" facs="#m-81651dd3-6d1e-4f4b-a07b-3b7087a47a00" label="lyrics-like">Dómine Jesu Christe, Fili Dei</l><l xml:id="m-5e6f09ba-93ed-433c-8aa6-812bfb566ca5" facs="#m-eacf3a09-e7d5-4b5f-a95b-01b5cb4accb4" label="lyrics-like">nóbis hódie: et dimitte nóbis débita</l><l xml:id="m-6129ab4a-7932-427a-858d-fd0bfdf61b3f" facs="#m-b12592d4-940b-4dc1-bcd6-2172da17a058" label="lyrics-like">nóstra, sicut et nos dimittimus de¬</l><l xml:id="m-b7193519-83bd-4143-a735-c50d1cc9226d" facs="#m-6cf6ccb5-3487-4d71-86c7-4a95d27a5b8f" label="lyrics-like">vivi, qui ex voluntáte Patris, coope¬</l><l xml:id="m-e4a34095-e4c5-4fcb-b094-0df57580941f" facs="#m-db06bfb4-11c6-43b9-8729-833d78b513ab" label="lyrics-like">bitóribus nóstris Et ne nos indúcas</l><l xml:id="m-cb18c210-03d0-40e1-8504-2813e9f82636" facs="#m-a32bbb69-240b-4295-8209-c6c813603ba8" label="lyrics-like">rante Spíritu Sancto, per mortem</l><l xml:id="m-b1f8d248-845e-4057-81ad-2cb378f6f2b8" facs="#m-830daa01-090e-46b0-b4c1-4001962463b2" label="lyrics-like">in tentatiónem. E. Sed libera nos</l><l xml:id="m-2c24d66d-cf92-4c6f-a4ac-049204984f7a" facs="#m-39bd9b00-29ae-4613-a3ea-ba1f593587a6" label="lyrics-like">tuam mundum vivificásti: libera</l><l xml:id="m-d919e8ab-604a-48ef-bfe7-bc8c0d2c452a" facs="#m-25b188f3-c7bb-4a28-a26d-158739342295" label="lyrics-like">a málo. The Priest says silentty</l><l xml:id="m-52a2582a-8998-46be-befe-f7e16955fb4d" facs="#m-a12c4337-bfe1-40fb-84d2-2bddf8c86bf3" label="lyrics-like">me per hoc sacrosánctum Corpus et</l><l xml:id="m-1fd2b442-1bbf-4a7a-a76c-f698cf22032e" facs="#m-c713e7dd-19a9-4de3-9d94-8ec281949745" label="ambiguous">Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-08b99414-bbba-4227-ac6c-40251def0e5c" facs="#m-5dfdfe15-3363-4332-8d81-a4e62d6793b8" label="lyrics-like">Sánguinem tuum ab ómnibus ini¬</l><l xml:id="m-4ca75b1b-57dc-4ff4-be3f-f6f69c763fd5" facs="#m-7e456894-1f20-48bb-b748-98a5de0a6438" label="lyrics-like">Libera nos, quaésumus Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-f42a1721-e0dc-468d-9deb-5cc037e5105e" facs="#m-2697edb3-a15d-4522-b853-5de2f299972e" label="lyrics-like">quitátibus meis et univérsis malis:</l><l xml:id="m-b9ace5a1-c874-4e4c-8623-9b682d3d0b34" facs="#m-8f9e2e89-fddf-4e8c-95b3-1abaade25251" label="lyrics-like">et fac me tuis semper inhaerére</l><l xml:id="m-c0fb2020-183a-4a2a-8752-4cd2bdbc231f" facs="#m-20fdeae8-df2c-4339-b31a-f38b536ad7a0" label="lyrics-like">ab ómnibus malis, praetéritis, prae¬</l><l xml:id="m-4201c527-ade6-4c3b-86de-156e6253a2da" facs="#m-6936375f-8086-4615-8257-f35c9ecfcbc8" label="lyrics-like">mandátis, et a te numquam sepa¬</l><l xml:id="m-e0b0bee5-6e01-45ea-9822-2f361a7b840c" facs="#m-00552ba1-7b6d-4f2d-994b-6b8b74c52514" label="lyrics-like">séntibus, et futúris : et intercedénte</l><l xml:id="m-730cc12b-9456-4568-b5b0-035939dfbc45" facs="#m-bffc2cce-f5bf-473a-834e-98d6e153ef63" label="lyrics-like">rári permittas : qui cum eódem Deo</l><l xml:id="m-4f8251f1-066d-4ef0-812d-9afbec7abd64" facs="#m-c0404d3d-77da-4ce8-b9e6-916097a6843d" label="lyrics-like">beáta et gloriósa semper Virgine</l><l xml:id="m-0179fec1-9af5-4a8f-bbd5-5d6b146b7ece" facs="#m-e37b1378-dcea-48a0-b84a-b959e6fe90c2" label="ambiguous">Patre, et Spiritu Sancto vivis et</l><l xml:id="m-5f565e54-af3b-4d13-9830-ae0fb1fffac0" facs="#m-40cf9211-b46b-40db-8084-ecb3f129e73b" label="lyrics-like">Dei Genitrice Maria, cum beãtis</l><l xml:id="m-7a297338-0017-45d4-87b5-78ff6802f9be" facs="#m-a1a9ecc7-b60e-4c14-9546-e43b38ade6b1" label="lyrics-like">regnas Deus in saécula saeculórum.</l><l xml:id="m-afd04856-bce2-49b3-a40b-11dccc67cefb" facs="#m-8a99f830-59ad-4b0c-b4bb-f6bf7565ab73" label="lyrics-like">Apóstolis tuis Petro et Paulo, atque</l><l xml:id="m-b5d46f06-57b0-4c48-9961-4488ebb5ce05" facs="#m-58e2886d-af16-41ca-b899-1462be3757cc" label="ambiguous">Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-693e68ad-67b1-47d2-809a-b45b06dfa9fe" facs="#m-d0a79a5c-8402-4fc4-9fca-390996e3ddb0" label="lyrics-like">Andréa, et ómnibus Sanctis, da</l><l xml:id="m-c510228b-cc11-4025-960b-f715304d410d" facs="#m-3c2c9ee4-203c-434d-a887-4a13144f22ba" label="lyrics-like">Percéptio Córporis tui, Dómine</l><l xml:id="m-f47b96d3-d9a0-4745-81c8-1cc560eda767" facs="#m-3873b96d-8e8c-4ea0-992d-f0c685ec4b25" label="lyrics-like">propítius pacem in diébus nostris:</l><l xml:id="m-7043a6e5-ca53-4520-b237-e6989795055e" facs="#m-e417e33b-f10a-40dd-a28f-c51fb6fbdb4f" label="lyrics-like">Jesu Christe, quod ego indígnus</l><l xml:id="m-121af87e-f83b-40c5-b361-0bf414dde303" facs="#m-8e70308c-7d11-4818-aa2c-3d15c10b45eb" label="lyrics-like">ut ope misericórdiae tuae adjúti, et</l><l xml:id="m-9364567a-c023-4707-934c-21a321516233" facs="#m-2f93941b-0812-4298-a886-ea8a83d2cc8a" label="lyrics-like">a peccáto simus semper liberi, et ab</l><l xml:id="m-30b580cb-74f6-4f61-b354-7fc455e96f53" facs="#m-14cae667-5360-45cb-9395-09a69d16fe6d" label="lyrics-like">súmere praesúmo, non mihi prové¬</l><l xml:id="m-e1aefec1-a00c-40f2-9eb2-2052161c4408" facs="#m-1cb6936a-0e44-41bb-bf41-76dd9abbad67" label="lyrics-like">omni perturbatióne secúri. Per</l><l xml:id="m-d66e10c6-470e-4697-b7c1-f86a187dfa09" facs="#m-e49a534b-e4f2-42c4-ae77-579e790e0543" label="lyrics-like">niat in judicium et condemnatió¬</l><l xml:id="m-cde689f7-db6f-4669-8975-4d2e01c28285" facs="#m-f5c62fc0-2d8b-48eb-84d0-9d1cdbdb6341" label="lyrics-like">eúmdem Dóminum nostrum Jesum ! nem: sed pro tua pietáte prosit</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>